    m_LineSpacing: 1.4
  m_Text: "Key Code: 1\n\nOur lone maintenance crew member appears to be seeking
    out more information regarding the project. He was only supposed to keep the
    ship functioning while our research was conducted, and now the organization fears
    that he knows too much. \n\nContinue to monitor his activity; should he begin
    to interfere with I.O.T.A., you are authorized to take more creative measures.
    For now his tasks are being made more difficult, more dangerous. It would be
    a shame if our AI were to become ... uncooperative. "
